### Section 15 — Debug common problems

| Problem                        | Possible cause                                         | Diagnosis and fix                                                                           |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Theme does not change          | CSS does not use the theme variables                   | Inspect <html> and verify data-theme changes between light and dark.                        |
